Ways to get spellbooks...

	Statues after dlvl:4 have a ~1/10 chance of containing a
spellbook.  So, it's not unusual to get a spellbook from Delphi.

	Your god may give you spellbooks if you pray on an aligned
altar.  If you have the eye and +oCM you can cast create monster
almost continuously.  Sac them until you get a burst of flame and
pray.  This is an excellent way to get all sorts of good stuff because
the monsters drop stuff, you can poly the stuff...  It's just good old
wizard fun.

	Have your pet take out priests if you don't need them for
protection anymore.  Note that taking out the priest yourself can
cause gods to get angry.  Especially coaligned priests.

	Polypiling.  But note that every time you poly a spellbook its
read count goes up, (I believe) so don't poly them too much, you will
blank them eventually.  


